Subject: glm: TF_GLM_PF_DOWN_FUSE review fixes: acq_rel counter adds after the
 warp barrier, optional fused symbols; glm-exl3-fuse GPU test

The writer warp's stores, then __syncwarp, then each counting lane's atom.acq_rel.gpu add; the completing lane's
acquire reaches the loading lanes through __syncwarp + __threadfence (Codex review 1). tf_exl3_prompt_down_fuse,
_k6_fuse and tf_glm_fold_slot resolve optionally: an image built before them still loads, the fused path is refused.
tf-cuda-test glm-exl3-fuse (TF_GLM_PF_DOWN_FUSE=1): cuda_exl3.runFused + fold byte-equal to run + put_slot + combine.

